<title>RUSSIA: Russia sets 25.78 pct interest payment on OFZ bond.</title>
<headline>Russia sets 25.78 pct interest payment on OFZ bond.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Russian Finance Ministry set a quarterly interest rate of 25.78 percent to be paid on August 6, 1997, on the series 24006 OFZ interest-bearing government bond, which matures on February 4, 1998, the Central Bank said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>			    6th coupon		5th coupon</p>
<p>    pct rate	    25.78		     29.28</p>
<p>    rouble terms	64,273		    72,999</p>
<p>    payment date	Aug 6, 1997	     May 7, 1997</p>
<p>--Anna Smirnova, Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
